                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "922cd840-de3c-4d3d-9e01-be8770f4a833",
                        "source_entry_id": "73ed8562-61f1-3b3a-9c21-0b1c0b2e8274",
                        "source_sense_id": "def1ac72-9c45-3d34-b3a2-1ecfa69de76b",
                        "source_sense_description": "weiblicher Vorname",
                        "target_lang_word": "Beatrice",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Beatrice",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8800e89c-4b05-3793-92ca-7076e3fd3201",
                                        "entry_id": "f9f5643b-68b8-3b35-bc24-e58d366c36fd",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A female given name from Latin."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "37c6b2c1-fb6f-47ca-97d2-d4d43d0daf3e",
                                                "sense_id": "8800e89c-4b05-3793-92ca-7076e3fd3201",
                                                "text": "I, with your two helps, will so practise on Benedick that, in despite of his quick wit and his queasy stomach, he shall fall in love with Beatrice."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "586c5bea-0f5f-479e-9901-a0b173563f70",
                                                "sense_id": "8800e89c-4b05-3793-92ca-7076e3fd3201",
                                                "text": "Petrarca had his Laura, and Dante his Beatrice, but Lorenzo has studiously concealed the name of the sovereign of his affections."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f62f7af3-a44b-4255-b173-72ca8881e7b6",
                                                "sense_id": "8800e89c-4b05-3793-92ca-7076e3fd3201",
                                                "text": "\"Seventeen years old - a senior in high school. Beatrice, her name is.\"\nBeatrice! Rebecca was struck dumb with admiration. Beatrice would be a female version of Tristram. Rebecca pictured her in a modest muslin dress from the nineteeth century, although she knew that was unlikely."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d67d9775-02a7-3446-abb4-e45ac2055f2e",
                                        "entry_id": "f9f5643b-68b8-3b35-bc24-e58d366c36fd",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A city, the county seat of Gage County, Nebraska, United States."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "27c1178e-f95e-42d9-90f2-2c8604e4b99e",
                        "source_entry_id": "73ed8562-61f1-3b3a-9c21-0b1c0b2e8274",
                        "source_sense_id": "def1ac72-9c45-3d34-b3a2-1ecfa69de76b",
                        "source_sense_description": "weiblicher Vorname",
                        "target_lang_word": "Béatrice",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Béatrice",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "64fc2c7a-7877-377e-bd03-56563e3559b9",
                                        "entry_id": "7767208b-fe74-3930-8f62-2e22fc74f95e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Prénom féminin."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d87f5003-4da0-4833-a60d-e13a917aa5b9",
                                                "sense_id": "64fc2c7a-7877-377e-bd03-56563e3559b9",
                                                "text": "Les Bleues, elles, ont largement de quoi faire tourner : des cadres, comme Pauletta Foppa, Cléopâtre Darleux ou Laura Flippes ont été mises au repos en tribune, tandis que Grâce Zaadi ou Béatrice Edwige n’ont même pas quitté le banc."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5be43753-ff54-4ff8-b8f5-ae781a208eba",
                                                "sense_id": "64fc2c7a-7877-377e-bd03-56563e3559b9",
                                                "text": "Et savez-vous, monsieur Dechartre, qu’il y a de méchants hommes qui disent que Béatrice n’a pas existé ?\nChoulette déclara qu’il était du nombre de ces méchants. Il ne croyait pas que Béatrice eût plus de réalité que ces autres dames par lesquelles les vieux poètes d’amour représentaient quelque idée scolastique d’une ridicule subtilité."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3dd0f850-30cf-4696-9514-8e2347c782fc",
                                                "sense_id": "64fc2c7a-7877-377e-bd03-56563e3559b9",
                                                "text": "Il n’y a aucune raison que ce soit simple, prévient d’emblée Béatrice Copper-Royer, psychologue clinicienne."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
